# Library API (Appwrite 1.5)

## 1. Auth & Account

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/account/sessions/email
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_IDENTIFIER}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.2 Register / Signup
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/account
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "unique()",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_PASSWORD}}",
    "name": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_USERNAME}}"
}

### 1.3 Profile (ต้องใส่ APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN ใน .env ก่อน)
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/account
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 1.4 Logout (ล้าง session เพื่อ login ใหม่ได้)
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/account/sessions/current
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

## 2. Categories

### 2.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentId": "unique()",
    "data": {
        "name": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_CREATE_NAME}}",
        "slug": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_CREATE_SLUG}}",
        "description": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_CREATE_DESCRIPTION}}"
    },
    "permissions": ["read(\"users\")", "update(\"users\")", "delete(\"users\")"]
}

### 2.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 2.3 List by slug (queries[0])
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"slug","values":["{{$dotenv CATEGORY_CREATE_SLUG}}"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 2.4 Get by ID
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv CATEGORY_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 2.5 Update
PATCH http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv CATEGORY_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_UPDATE_NAME}}",
        "description": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_UPDATE_DESCRIPTION}}"
    }
}

### 2.6 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_CATEGORY_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv CATEGORY_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

## 3. Books

### 3.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentId": "unique()",
    "data": {
        "title": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_TITLE}}",
        "author": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_AUTHOR}}",
        "isbn": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_ISBN}}",
        "publisher": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_PUBLISHER}}",
        "publish_year": {{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_PUBLISH_YEAR}},
        "category_id": "{{$dotenv CATEGORY_ID}}",
        "total_copies": {{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_TOTAL_COPIES}},
        "available_copies": {{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_AVAILABLE_COPIES}},
        "cover_url": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_COVER_URL}}",
        "description": "{{$dotenv BOOK_CREATE_DESCRIPTION}}"
    },
    "permissions": ["read(\"users\")", "update(\"users\")", "delete(\"users\")"]
}

### 3.2 List All (limit + orderDesc)
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"limit","values":[25]}&queries[1]={"method":"orderDesc","attribute":"title"}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 3.3 List by category (queries[0] + queries[1])
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"category_id","values":["{{$dotenv CATEGORY_ID}}"]}&queries[1]={"method":"limit","values":[25]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 3.4 List available only
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"greaterThan","attribute":"available_copies","values":[0]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 3.5 Get by ID
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 3.6 Update
PATCH http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "title": "{{$dotenv BOOK_UPDATE_TITLE}}",
        "publisher": "{{$dotenv BOOK_UPDATE_PUBLISHER}}",
        "available_copies": {{$dotenv BOOK_UPDATE_AVAILABLE_COPIES}},
        "description": "{{$dotenv BOOK_UPDATE_DESCRIPTION}}"
    }
}

### 3.7 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BOOK_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

## 4. Profiles

### 4.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentId": "unique()",
    "data": {
        "user_id": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_USER_ID}}",
        "member_id": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_MEMBER_ID}}",
        "name": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_NAME}}",
        "email": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_EMAIL}}",
        "phone": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_PHONE}}",
        "role": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_ROLE}}",
        "joined_at": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_JOINED_AT}}"
    },
    "permissions": ["read(\"users\")", "update(\"users\")", "delete(\"users\")"]
}

### 4.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 4.3 Get my profile by user_id
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"user_id","values":["{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_USER_ID}}"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 4.4 Get by member_id
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"member_id","values":["{{$dotenv PROFILE_CREATE_MEMBER_ID}}"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 4.5 Get by ID
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv PROFILE_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 4.6 Update
PATCH http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv PROFILE_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_UPDATE_NAME}}",
        "phone": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_UPDATE_PHONE}}",
        "role": "{{$dotenv PROFILE_UPDATE_ROLE}}"
    }
}

### 4.7 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_PROFILE_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv PROFILE_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

## 5. Borrowings

### 5.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentId": "unique()",
    "data": {
        "user_id": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_USER_ID}}",
        "book_id": "{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}",
        "borrow_date": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_BORROW_DATE}}",
        "due_date": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_DUE_DATE}}",
        "status": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_STATUS}}",
        "fine": {{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_FINE}}
    },
    "permissions": ["read(\"users\")", "update(\"users\")", "delete(\"users\")"]
}

### 5.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 5.3 List borrowed by this user
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"user_id","values":["{{$dotenv BORROWING_CREATE_USER_ID}}"]}&queries[1]={"method":"equal","attribute":"status","values":["borrowed"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 5.4 List overdue (due_date < OVERDUE_BEFORE_DATE, status = borrowed)
### ค่า datetime ใน query ต้องเป็นรูปแบบ Z ห้ามใช้ +00:00 เพราะ `+` ใน URL จะถูกอ่านเป็นช่องว่าง
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"lessThan","attribute":"due_date","values":["{{$dotenv OVERDUE_BEFORE_DATE}}"]}&queries[1]={"method":"equal","attribute":"status","values":["borrowed"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 5.5 List by book_id
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"book_id","values":["{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 5.6 Get by ID
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BORROWING_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 5.7 Update (คืนหนังสือ)
PATCH http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BORROWING_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "status": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_UPDATE_STATUS}}",
        "return_date": "{{$dotenv BORROWING_UPDATE_RETURN_DATE}}",
        "fine": {{$dotenv BORROWING_UPDATE_FINE}}
    }
}

### 5.8 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_BORROWING_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv BORROWING_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

## 6. Reservations

### 6.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentId": "unique()",
    "data": {
        "user_id": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_CREATE_USER_ID}}",
        "book_id": "{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}",
        "reserved_at": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_CREATE_RESERVED_AT}}",
        "queue_position": {{$dotenv RESERVATION_CREATE_QUEUE_POSITION}},
        "note": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_CREATE_NOTE}}"
    },
    "permissions": ["read(\"users\")", "update(\"users\")", "delete(\"users\")"]
}

### 6.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 6.3 List waiting queue of a book (orderAsc)
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"book_id","values":["{{$dotenv BOOK_ID}}"]}&queries[1]={"method":"equal","attribute":"status","values":["waiting"]}&queries[2]={"method":"orderAsc","attribute":"queue_position"}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 6.4 List my reservations
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents?queries[0]={"method":"equal","attribute":"user_id","values":["{{$dotenv RESERVATION_CREATE_USER_ID}}"]}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 6.5 Get by ID
GET http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv RESERVATION_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}

### 6.6 Update
PATCH http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv RESERVATION_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "status": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_UPDATE_STATUS}}",
        "fulfilled_at": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_UPDATE_FULFILLED_AT}}",
        "note": "{{$dotenv RESERVATION_UPDATE_NOTE}}"
    }
}

### 6.7 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_RESERVATION_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv RESERVATION_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Session: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_SESSION_TOKEN}}